    "title": "Woman in custody after stabbing at Southpark Gardens - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bob Bakken ,\n2 hours ago SOUTHAVEN, Miss. — A domestic dispute at a Southaven apartment complex turned violent Wednesday, leaving one man injured and a female suspect in police custody. Police say a male victim arrived at Baptist Memorial Hospital-DeSoto to receive treatment for a stab wound. Officers later placed a woman in custody in connection with the incident. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
